{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1000_024ann", "source_sha256": "a49e04142cda03abde8b1d133ecce5e591f3bde5657801145307c22276981732", "ja": "うう、やっちゃった……恥ずかしい……。\nみんな……しっかり、見てた……よね。", "zh": "呜呜，搞砸了……好丢脸……\n大家……都看得……清清楚楚吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1001_p", "source_sha256": "038f89a3ea8cd95a906b59f596369852fb3fe3d147b6f451fa1c08f76907e509", "ja": "お疲れ様、杏奈。着替えはもう終わって……ん？\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，杏奈。已经换好衣服了……嗯？\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "5291eb3a85ccaaa936b8151e2412a7591541a4ade9a792effe5a82c5730887b0", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん……。\nえっと……杏奈、衣装に着替えてたんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……  \n那个……杏奈刚才在换演出服，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "347b3225ceba8c99cb17d6fd52cffe119ccafe84850abc3f9bbead9a8c948b2c", "ja": "控室に、忘れ物しちゃって……。\nでも、着替えてる途中だったから……。", "zh": "我把东西忘在休息室了……  \n可是，因为当时还换到一半……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "3a4ff5cfded234e3da84e31eddf905683754481e5761aaf17294c4a7543b5470", "ja": "うさ耳、付けたままだったの……！", "zh": "还戴着兔耳朵呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0df836f5c8779346eb05fed933bc0bb69e01e4f3cde6d654b0f8777b2eb315b3", "ja": "ああ、みんなにうさ耳姿を披露しちゃったのか。\nそんなに落ち込まなくても……。", "zh": "啊，原来你就这样戴着兔耳朵给大家看了啊。\n不用这么沮丧吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "9b4299b9cfbe3bae34241deed7b4e583790cfea8a7d7a9c690ec2602027e18e1", "ja": "でも、変……だよね？\nうさ耳、こんなに大きいのに……。", "zh": "不过，很奇怪……对吧？\n兔耳朵明明这么大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d96856e4b256cefa122ccb627978d3b843a6382ffd44195abfc0c4d7f0277dc1", "ja": "うーん、大丈夫じゃないか？　杏奈がバニーポリスの\n仕事をしてるのは、みんな知ってるわけだし。", "zh": "嗯——应该没问题吧？毕竟大家都知道杏奈在做兔女郎警察的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1008_p", "source_sha256": "dc6038222f30503572c374a5bdf05c5c9d5951e46e55276f4cf90a27d621b89b", "ja": "みんなには、何か言われたのか？", "zh": "大家对你说了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "a561d7dc88c2bcfb2177eccc2e24ecca394d6ca534fc45498ebc6473a1972372", "ja": "えっと……亜利沙が、悶えてた……？\nあと、みんなが……「かわいい」って……。", "zh": "那个……亚利沙好像在扭来扭去……？\n还有，大家都说……“好可爱”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "6d30cb177ca26bdd4fc35c6a5623c39ef8dd9951d5360caa7de79f05dc081827", "ja": "その時は、なんでかわからなくて……。\nここに戻ってきて、鏡見て……気付いた……。", "zh": "那时候，我也不知道是为什么……。\n回到这里照了镜子……才发现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c8e84ecaa6da8e7600561f410d6e9de2bb9bd4c4813accb49240bcbe49f1fad5", "ja": "かわいいって言われたなら、いいじゃないか。\n何かダメな理由でもあるのか？", "zh": "被说可爱，不是挺好的吗？\n难道有什么不好的理由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "f0a2aca09f49bd8ad69df5635fbafb807b195f2c0bd7182cbac29efdf7d45a28", "ja": "だって……杏奈、バニーポリスだし！\nカッコいいって思われなくちゃ！", "zh": "可是……杏奈是兔女郎警察嘛！\n得让大家觉得帅气才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b49d1847c38cd3e99cfd2f4b2b2356cfc8662650e7a86f5f1f3f26123592f620", "ja": "そうか？　今の杏奈も、カッコイイと思うけどな！\n強そうなオーラを感じるっていうか。", "zh": "是吗？不过我觉得现在的杏奈也很帅气啊！\n该说是能感受到一股很强的气场吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "cad0a5d0a1fb2a9177109de399f0bbf0aabf88c7d8a5fce264eaa1b064db601f", "ja": "ほ、本当……？　\n杏奈……ちゃんと、カッコいい……？", "zh": "真、真的吗……？  \n杏奈……真的很帅气……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1015_p", "source_sha256": "16540a3e30c1afe1898c494d8671101fc7fcc77dfb821b55b21128bad59f3d4d", "ja": "もちろん！　あ、そうだ。\n今から、控室に行ってみたらどうだ？", "zh": "当然！啊，对了。要不要现在去休息室看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "a64e88481beef7a32a16605f1787123c3b7907b42c7a13ab22b862aaf66ad4cc", "ja": "え、また？", "zh": "诶，还要去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0654_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3ff3dc09aefdf12582ed0e737ff68cd5955358568616c19da34464d13c52e35a", "ja": "うん。今のバニーポリスの衣装を着た\n杏奈を見たら、みんな違う反応をすると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯。要是大家看到现在穿着兔女郎警察服装的杏奈，应该都会有不同的反应吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
